sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CI
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as modelservice-controller-manager<br/>8081/TCP Health, 8443/TCP Metrics
    participant ChildRes as Child Resources<br/>(Deployments, Services, RBAC, etc.)

    Note over User,ChildRes: Flow 1: ModelService Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE ModelService CR<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: User credentials
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch notification<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET ModelService CR<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: ModelService spec

    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET BaseConfig ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: BaseConfig data

    Note over Controller: Template interpolation<br/>(Go text/template + sprig)<br/>Merge BaseConfig + ModelService<br/>(mergo deep merge)

    Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE Prefill Deployment<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE Decode Deployment<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE EPP Deployment + Service<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE InferencePool + InferenceModel<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE ServiceAccount + RoleBinding<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ChildRes: Resources created/updated

    Controller->>K8sAPI: UPDATE ModelService/status<br/>(prefill/decode/EPP readiness)<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over User,ChildRes: Metrics Scrape Flow

    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS<br/>Auth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Metrics response
